            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Draftava 1.2.6

- Paste a copied web URL onto selected text to create a Markdown link.
- Improve link editing: click a link to reveal its Markdown source and Command-click to open it in the browser.
- Narrow the native Help menu while retaining the macOS Help search.
- Tune the Clicky typing sound set so the R2 key sound better matches the rest of the theme.
]]></description>
